#X text 20 10 tremolo-gate — Amplitude modulation with variable shape — from smooth vintage tremolo to hard rhythmic gating. The shape control morphs between sine (smooth) and square (choppy). Stereo phase offset creates ping-pong effects. Can sync to sequencer tempo.;
